00:26:45.372 --> 00:26:47.190
I would always get a little pep in my step

00:26:47.190 --> 00:26:49.958
because I knew it was a special day.

00:26:49.958 --> 00:26:52.516
And clothes is way more
powerful than wine,

00:26:52.516 --> 00:26:55.009
so I totally get it, go ahead.

00:26:55.009 --> 00:26:58.410
- So, you know, these are
fresh flower garlands.

00:26:58.410 --> 00:27:00.417
They look like lays almost.

00:27:00.417 --> 00:27:03.392
