00:28:15.336 --> 00:28:17.351
Now it is about you.

00:28:17.351 --> 00:28:19.236
- You don't have the flowers,
you don't have the product,

00:28:19.236 --> 00:28:21.675
you're gonna have to make it about you.

00:28:21.675 --> 00:28:25.842
Your family's journey from
Pakistan to the States.

00:28:28.011 --> 00:28:30.391
Extended family allows
you to put on all of them.

00:28:30.391 --> 00:28:33.311
Like this is the time to do story time

00:28:33.311 --> 00:28:36.806
