conversation and by DMing

00:29:22.013 --> 00:29:24.816
a hundred a day, biz deving that way.

00:29:24.816 --> 00:29:26.431
I think that's incredible.

00:29:26.431 --> 00:29:28.332
- Yeah, definitely I love.

00:29:28.332 --> 00:29:30.785
I mean and I just want to shout out to all

00:29:30.785 --> 00:29:33.687
of the other brown moms
