so many women coming.

00:29:42.194 --> 00:29:43.204
- Amara--

00:29:43.204 --> 00:29:45.748
- You know coming up and
just coming over stereotypes,

00:29:45.748 --> 00:29:46.581
I love it.

00:29:46.581 --> 00:29:47.439
It's so amazing.

00:29:47.439 --> 00:29:48.539
- Unlimited.

00:29:48.539 --> 00:29:52.956
Like just so many of the
subcultures of Brown culture

00:29:54.917 --> 00:29:57.785
are so entrepreneurial by nature

00:29:57.785 --> 00:29:58.618
and the internet

00:29:58.618 --> 00:30:02.951
has allowed mom to thrive
in a way that mom couldn't

00:30:04.092 --> 00:30:07.722
in 1974 and this is why I
keep going back to gratitude.

00:30:07.722 --> 00:30:10.788
The fucking internet, like come on.

00:30:10.788 --> 00:30:13.690
Imagine corona with pre internet?

00:30:13.690 --> 00:30:15.172
Like we'd get sick of
television, music and video

00:30:15.172 --> 00:30:18.407
games pretty quickly in 1987.

00:30:18.407 --> 00:30:21.729
You know like what a blessing.

00:30:21.729 --> 00:30:24.420
- Yeah, we can definitely
still connect with each

00:30:24.420 --> 00:30:26.068
other and our parents and
grandparents didn't have

00:30:26.068 --> 00:30:29.152
that opportunity during times of--

00:30:29.152 --> 00:30:31.450
- You know what's another
thing back to immigrant

00:30:31.450 --> 00:30:34.573
culture, so many people
connecting with their loved ones

00:30:34.573 --> 00:30:38.928
now on Zoom and Google
Hangouts 'cause that 60, 70,

00:30:38.928 --> 00:30:41.320
80, 90-year-old set is
being forced to learn

00:30:41.320 --> 00:30:43.796
some technologies that
they pushed against.

00:30:43.796 --> 00:30:44.912
And they're loving it.

00:30:44.912 --> 00:30:47.740
So that's been a great gift,
that's been a great gift.

00:30:47.740 --> 00:30:49.078
The amount of people that
are going to interact

00:30:49.078 --> 00:30:52.102
with their grandma back
home in the old country,

00:30:52.102 --> 00:30:55.349
a 100x more over the next
three years before she

00:30:55.349 --> 00:30:57.960
passes, that would have
never happened on corona

00:30:57.960 --> 00:31:00.292
because it was a once
every six months phone call

00:31:00.292 --> 00:31:03.220
and now it's a once-a-week
Zoom on Friday nights.

00:31:03.220 --> 00:31:04.179
It's a blessing.

00:31:04.179 --> 00:31:06.510
There's so many blessings that are coming.

00:31:06.510 --> 00:31:08.842
- My grandfather used
to send audio cassettes

00:31:08.842 --> 00:31:10.161
to my dad.

00:31:10.161 --> 00:31:11.514
Like that's old school.

00:31:11.514 --> 00:31:14.163
He used to record an audio
cassette because they

00:31:14.163 --> 00:31:16.298
