00:31:16.298 --> 00:31:17.928
- When my parents came to America--

00:31:17.928 --> 00:31:20.870
- It's amazing how can
connect and we can FaceTime.

00:31:20.870 --> 00:31:23.135
- They wrote letters, letters
that took three months

00:31:23.135 --> 00:31:23.968
to get here.

00:31:23.968 --> 00:31:26.364
I mean so, anyway, Amara proud of you.

00:31:26.364 --> 00:31:27.197
Talk to you soon.

00:31:27.197 --> 00:31:30.197
- Thank you so much Gary, thank you.

