00:32:01.409 --> 00:32:02.596
- Where are you from?

00:32:02.596 --> 00:32:06.846
- I'm from the Jersey shore,
so kinda close to you.

00:32:07.958 --> 00:32:10.716
So I wanted to tell you
how I actually found you.

00:32:10.716 --> 00:32:14.427
You showed up on my
Instagram explore like maybe

00:32:14.427 --> 00:32:17.182
over the summer and it
was when you were doing

00:32:17.182 --> 00:32:21.792
yard saleing, so that's
kind of like my business

00:32:21.792 --> 00:32:24.132
that's what I started out doing.

00:32:24.132 --> 00:32:27.491
I grew up from a teen mom, so
I lived with my grandparents,

00:32:27.491 --> 00:32:29.241
my mom, we were good.

00:32:30.102 --> 00:32:31.824
Things were covered but
like at the end of the

00:32:31.824 --> 00:32:33.429
month there wasn't always a lot left over

00:32:33.429 --> 00:32:36.042
so we were always like super, always out

00:32:36.042 --> 00:32:40.566
at the flea markets or just
trying to make things work.

00:32:40.566 --> 00:32:43.007
I wouldn't say I was like entrepreneurial

00:32:43.007 --> 00:32:45.020
and then I went to college for advertising

00:32:45.020 --> 00:32:47.370
and it was like my school
year we were leaving

00:32:47.370 --> 00:32:49.736
and I noticed people
were throwing furniture

00:32:49.736 --> 00:32:51.538
away on the curb at the end of the year

00:32:51.538 --> 00:32:55.658
and I as like, my neighbor
who had a pick-up truck.

00:32:55.658 --> 00:32:57.637
I just grabbed all the
furniture I brought it home

00:32:57.637 --> 00:32:59.494
and I sold it on Craigslist.

00:32:59.494 --> 00:33:02.919
And some of it I painted,
some of it, I sold it as-is.

00:33:02.919 --> 00:33:05.402
And I was like this is insane.

00:33:05.402 --> 00:33:06.640
- That's smart.

00:33:06.640 --> 00:33:09.076
- Yeah, so I worked in
corporate America for 10 years,

00:33:09.076 --> 00:33:12.088
but like painting furniture
and reselling it on Craigslist

00:33:12.088 --> 00:33:15.040
and now Facebook Marketplace
was always like my side hustle.

00:33:15.040 --> 00:33:15.945
- Your side hustle.

00:33:15.945 --> 00:33:18.577
- Yeah and then three
years ago I had my son

00:33:18.577 --> 00:33:21.355
and I was like ah man,
I don't want to leave

00:33:21.355 --> 00:33:23.678
and go to work and come
home and be miserable.

00:33:23.678 --> 00:33:28.192
So I'm just gonna like go
full force into my business.

00:33:28.192 --> 00:33:29.025
So I did.

00:33:29.025 --> 00:33:31.799
Yeah, so it kind of went
from like painting furniture

00:33:31.799 --> 00:33:35.678
and posting it on Craigslist
to kind of getting

00:33:35.678 --> 00:33:38.357
a little bit of notoriety in my town.

00:33:38.357 --> 00:33:40.618
And then I was taking on commission work

00:33:40.618 --> 00:33:43.662
and then I was looking
for places to get stuff

00:33:43.662 --> 00:33:46.181
to put on my furniture to take pictures

00:33:46.181 --> 00:33:48.198
and then I kinda got into antiques

00:33:48.198 --> 00:33:50.922
and it kinda like spiraled.

00:33:50.922 --> 00:33:52.839
And then I was like, maybe I
should open a brick and mortar

00:33:52.839 --> 00:33:54.929
store, but then I was like I don't know,

00:33:54.929 --> 00:33:56.424
that's all a big commitment.

00:33:56.424 --> 00:33:58.204
So then I found an antique mall

00:33:58.204 --> 00:34:00.242
actually in Point Pleasant, New Jersey.

00:34:00.242 --> 00:34:01.199
So I pay them rent.

00:34:01.199 --> 00:34:02.032
- I know it.

00:34:02.032 --> 00:34:03.653
- And I have a booth there.

00:34:03.653 --> 00:34:06.586
And I was like, yes, this is so smart

00:34:06.586 --> 00:34:08.156
