I can't go to the flea

00:34:30.307 --> 00:34:32.890
markets, I can't go to anywhere

00:34:34.541 --> 00:34:35.935
and we're kind of just
like stuck in the house

00:34:35.935 --> 00:34:38.427
and I'm like, okay, what am I gonna do.

00:34:38.427 --> 00:34:41.873
And like my art and I know you get it

00:34:41.873 --> 00:34:43.963
because I saw it in your
face when you were going

00:34:43.963 --> 00:34:46.479
to flea markets, it's like
the thrill of the hunt.

00:34:46.479 --> 00:34:47.843
Like you must get with a client.

00:34:47.843 --> 00:34:50.547
It's like I'm gonna pull,
like you pull something out

00:34:50.547 --> 00:34:54.938
and you're like this was $2
and I could sell this for 50.

00:34:54.938 --> 00:34:56.115
I can't do that anymore.

00:34:56.115 --> 00:34:58.652
So it's almost like you're
like a caged animal.

00:34:58.652 --> 00:35:01.149
- I mean I'm so devastated
that we're gonna miss

00:35:01.149 --> 00:35:05.497
town-wide garage sale
season here in Jersey

00:35:05.497 --> 00:35:06.723
for April and May.

00:35:06.723 --> 00:35:08.897
